Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.47,0:00:40.97,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460,192)}Executive Producer: Hiroshi OKAWA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:47.69,Credits,,0,0,0,,Producer: Isamu TAKAHASHI\NScript: Sumie TANAKA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:50.73,Credits,,0,0,0,,Directed by:\NTaiji YABUSHITA, Yugo SERIKAWA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:53.70,Credits,,0,0,0,,Animation Supervisor: Sanae YAMAMOTO\NMusic: Chuji KINOSHITA, Hajime KABURAGI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:56.78,Credits,,0,0,0,,Lead Animators:\NAkira DAIKUBARA, Yasuji MORI,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:59.78,Credits,,0,0,0,,Yasuo OTSUKA, Hideo FURUSAWA,\NMasao KUMAGAWA, Daikichiro KUSUBE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.91,0:01:02.87,Credits,,0,0,0,,Animation: Shuji KONNO, Masatake KITA,\NReiko OKUYAMA, Makoto NAGASAWA,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:05.62,Credits,,0,0,0,,Chikao TERA, Michihiko YOSHIDA,\NTaku SUGIYAMA, Toyohei HORIKAWA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:08.04,Credits,,0,0,0,,Art Director: Seiichi TORIIZUKA\NColor Design: Reiji KOYAMA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:10.92,Credits,,0,0,0,,Backgrounds: Mataji URATA\NSaburo YOKOI, Hideo CHIBA\NResearch: Koji FUKIYA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:13.67,Credits,,0,0,0,,Camera: Seigo OTSUKA,\NKazuo NAKAMURA, Takaharu AZUMA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:17.47,Credits,,0,0,0,,Sound: Masatoshi KUGA,\NTakeshi MORI, Hajime KIMURA\NEditing: Shintaro MIYAMOTO, Ikuzo INABA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:20.05,Credits,,0,0,0,,Ink: Mitsuo SHINDOU, Fumie MOTOHASHI,\NMasako MIYAZAKI, Nobuko YOSHIDA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:23.35,Credits,,0,0,0,,Paint: Fukiko HAYASHI,\NJunko KAWASHIMA, Yoshiko NAKAJIMA\NChecking: Saburo NIIRO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:28.86,Credits,,0,0,0,,Song Lyrics: Chuji KINOSHITA\NSingers: Tomoko MATSUSHIMA, Keiko NOZAWA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.06,0:01:36.03,Credits,,0,0,0,,Cast:\NYoshiko SAKUMA, Jo MIZUKI, Kinya KITAOJI,\NIsuzu YAMADA, Tomohito SUMIDA, Junya USAMI
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:43.08,Credits,,0,0,0,,So YAMAMURA, Tomoko MATSUSHIMA,\NMikijiro HIRA, Masao MISHIMA,\NYasushi NAGATA, Eijiro TONO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:49.42,Credits,,0,0,0,,Nakajiro TOMITA, Masao ODA,\NUshio AKASHI, Harue TONE,\NShigeko ARAI, Tokue HANAZAWA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:54.96,Credits,,0,0,0,,Junji MASUDA, Reiko MUTO,\NKoji KIYOMURA, Koji SEKIYAMA,\NKenji USHIO, Toru OHIRA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:09.79,Text,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.87,0:03:11.96,Text,,0,0,0,,Where is Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:15.75,Text,,0,0,0,,He's out protecting the Emperor's land.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:18.05,Text,,0,0,0,,Let's go find him, Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:22.43,Text,,0,0,0,,You may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:34.40,Song,,0,0,0,,Spring has come to Seven Mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:39.69,Song,,0,0,0,,Spring has come passing through the woods
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:45.45,Song,,0,0,0,,With sweet voices,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:50.62,Song,,0,0,0,,The birds are singing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.91,0:03:55.50,Song,,0,0,0,,And the wind gently blows
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:58.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Come, spring
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:01.47,Song,,0,0,0,,Come, friends
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:05.72,Song,,0,0,0,,The sun softly shines
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:09.72,Text,,0,0,0,,It's Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:21.99,Text,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ranmaru! Good dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:24.36,Text,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:27.03,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju and Zushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:28.83,Text,,0,0,0,,We came to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:32.91,Text,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I was just about to head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:34.87,Text,,0,0,0,,Father,...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:39.00,Text,,0,0,0,,...the baby deer have already grown so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.51,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:46.72,Text,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hear a bear crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:52.39,Text,,0,0,0,,It hurts! It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:04.99,Text,,0,0,0,,It hurts! It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:08.62,Text,,0,0,0,,You're exaggerating, Moku!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:10.79,Text,,0,0,0,,It's not that bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:12.91,Text,,0,0,0,,What happened, Chonko?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:17.08,Text,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a big thorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.71,0:05:19.63,Text,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:41.77,Text,,0,0,0,,Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:47.86,Text,,0,0,0,,You're alright now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:06:00.00,Text,,0,0,0,,My Lord, the governor of Mutsu has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:03.59,Text,,0,0,0,,Onikura has come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.13,0:06:12.81,Text,,0,0,0,,I want you to give me\Na definitive answer today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:20.56,Text,,0,0,0,,Will you give me permission\Nto marry your daughter, Anju?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:23.82,Text,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:26.61,Text,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:31.91,Text,,0,0,0,,Iwaki! What is your answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.07,0:06:37.87,Text,,0,0,0,,But Onikura, no matter how much you\Nwant to marry her, she's still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:43.54,Text,,0,0,0,,Of course. That's what makes her so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:48.17,Text,,0,0,0,,Besides, my daughter doesn't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:50.59,Text,,0,0,0,,Alright. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:54.14,Text,,0,0,0,,However, Iwaki,...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:07:00.02,Text,,0,0,0,,...it would be more convenient for you\Nif you didn't decline my proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:02.48,Text,,0,0,0,,I say this as your superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:04.52,Text,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:44.81,Text,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:59.66,Text,,0,0,0,,Why you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:02.29,Text,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:19.68,Text,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless, My Lord. Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:27.15,Text,,0,0,0,,- Hey, start a fire over there!\N- Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:32.19,Text,,0,0,0,,Uh, we can't. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:37.87,Captions,,0,0,0,,"This land is the property of the Emperor."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:40.95,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Hunting birds and animals is prohibited."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:45.54,Text,,0,0,0,,Never mind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:53.30,Text,,0,0,0,,My Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:09:00.14,Text,,0,0,0,,Kill all the animals that run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:40.18,Text,,0,0,0,,Moku, it's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.85,0:09:49.06,Text,,0,0,0,,Moku, wake up right now! Moku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:56.36,Text,,0,0,0,,Fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:07.08,Text,,0,0,0,,- Capture those animals!\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:26.23,Text,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:29.69,Text,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:35.07,Text,,0,0,0,,Moku!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:50.96,Text,,0,0,0,,Moku!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:59.26,Text,,0,0,0,,Now you can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:02.34,Text,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:05.89,Text,,0,0,0,,Onikura, you are no longer in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:09.81,Text,,0,0,0,,I captured that animal. Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:13.73,Text,,0,0,0,,This bear belongs to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:16.90,Text,,0,0,0,,- No it doesn't!\N- Yes, it lives on the reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:20.65,Text,,0,0,0,,And it's my job to protect\Neverything on the Emperor's land.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.03,0:11:22.11,Text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:26.04,Text,,0,0,0,,Are you defying your superior?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:31.12,Text,,0,0,0,,Father! This man set fire\Nto the Emperor's mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:34.88,Text,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:39.26,Text,,0,0,0,,I found his bag of flint.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:41.84,Text,,0,0,0,,That's his crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:46.97,Text,,0,0,0,,And don't forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:16.42,Behind the Scenes,,0,0,0,,"It's an outrage that Officer Masauji Iwaki\Nset fire to the Emperor's forest,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:22.88,Behind the Scenes,,0,0,0,,"and killed all the animals.\NTherefore, I submit this complaint."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:32.43,Behind the Scenes,,0,0,0,,"Imperial Order:"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:39.94,Behind the Scenes,,0,0,0,,"Officer Masauji Iwaki shall report\Nto Kyoto immediately for interrogation."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:45.41,Text,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:48.78,Text,,0,0,0,,You need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:51.12,Text,,0,0,0,,Dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:58.54,Text,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about.\NI'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:15.19,Text,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't Father returned yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:19.32,Text,,0,0,0,,It's already been half a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:32.54,Text,,0,0,0,,Lord Onikura is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:35.62,Text,,0,0,0,,What now, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:38.58,Text,,0,0,0,,That's Onikura's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:42.50,Text,,0,0,0,,By order of the Emperor,\NI've come to claim this property.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:44.84,Text,,0,0,0,,Open the gate immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:48.30,Text,,0,0,0,,No, I don't believe any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:49.60,Text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:53.60,Text,,0,0,0,,Come on, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.39,0:13:57.10,Text,,0,0,0,,Break it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:10.03,Text,,0,0,0,,Terrible news!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:13.83,Text,,0,0,0,,Your father has been found guilty,\Nand we must leave this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:16.54,Text,,0,0,0,,No way! This is Father's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:19.12,Text,,0,0,0,,He's not a bad man. It's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:22.42,Text,,0,0,0,,But for now we must escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:27.59,Text,,0,0,0,,That's true. Let's go find Father\Nand appeal to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.93,0:14:29.51,Text,,0,0,0,,Come, we must hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:44.98,Text,,0,0,0,,My Lord, we can't find them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:47.61,Text,,0,0,0,,They've escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:50.57,Text,,0,0,0,,- Go find them!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.61,0:14:51.57,Text,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:14.47,Text,,0,0,0,,Time to say goodbye to our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.31,0:15:20.56,Text,,0,0,0,,Where did they run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:24.65,Text,,0,0,0,,Seems like they tricked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:48.46,Text,,0,0,0,,Damn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.78,0:16:18.62,Text,,0,0,0,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.01,0:16:34.26,Text,,0,0,0,,My Lord, let's just go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:36.09,Text,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:38.72,Text,,0,0,0,,This is nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:58.20,Text,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:33.74,Text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:41.16,Text,,0,0,0,,Moku, I'm cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:18:11.44,Song,,0,0,0,,Go to sleep, good children, go to sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:21.37,Song,,0,0,0,,Behind the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:27.75,Song,,0,0,0,,An owl is hooting
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:42.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Slave traders reported in this area."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:47.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Be wary of offering\Naccomodations to strangers."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:55.28,Text,,0,0,0,,I want that bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:18:58.11,Text,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.38,Text,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:29.48,Text,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:37.15,Text,,0,0,0,,Ranmaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:39.53,Text,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:41.74,Text,,0,0,0,,I live nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:46.37,Text,,0,0,0,,I felt sorry for you, so I brought this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:52.37,Text,,0,0,0,,Please, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:54.92,Text,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.46,Text,,0,0,0,,Where are you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:19:59.80,Text,,0,0,0,,To the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:02.18,Text,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kyoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:06.43,Text,,0,0,0,,There are many dangerous\Nareas on the way there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.60,0:20:09.22,Text,,0,0,0,,It's difficult to go with children.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:14.56,Text,,0,0,0,,Actually, tomorrow there's\Na boat that leaves for Yura.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:16.77,Text,,0,0,0,,Why not take that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:21.57,Text,,0,0,0,,Thank you, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:22.82,Text,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:28.66,Text,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot about\Nyour loyal followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:30.29,Text,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:50.52,Text,,0,0,0,,Tatsuko...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.97,0:20:55.27,Text,,0,0,0,,How does that sound to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:21:00.36,Text,,0,0,0,,Sounds good. Yamaoka Taifu\Nworked everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:04.86,Text,,0,0,0,,Jinpachi, you're okay with the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.03,0:21:06.70,Text,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.99,0:21:09.91,Text,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:19.67,Text,,0,0,0,,Here, the children will take this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:24.47,Text,,0,0,0,,What? We're taking separate boats?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:25.84,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.59,0:21:29.64,Text,,0,0,0,,That way the boats travel faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.39,0:21:35.69,Text,,0,0,0,,Here, step on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:41.44,Text,,0,0,0,,And the animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.48,0:21:43.49,Text,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:46.99,Text,,0,0,0,,When they arrive,\NI'll take them in the next boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:50.12,Text,,0,0,0,,Come on, get those boats moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.81,0:22:21.86,Text,,0,0,0,,I think we've been drugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.65,0:22:27.03,Text,,0,0,0,,Moku, I can't move at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.87,0:22:39.00,Text,,0,0,0,,Which one is first?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.54,0:22:42.04,Text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:45.01,Text,,0,0,0,,We're drifting away from the other boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:50.09,Text,,0,0,0,,- Mother!\N- Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.43,0:22:51.93,Text,,0,0,0,,Let me steer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:53.64,Text,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.64,0:22:59.02,Text,,0,0,0,,You tricked us, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.02,0:23:04.77,Text,,0,0,0,,Here, take this.\NJust bring us to the other boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.40,0:23:10.86,Text,,0,0,0,,It's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.49,0:23:16.95,Text,,0,0,0,,- Mother!\N- Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.45,0:23:19.71,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.91,0:23:21.83,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.71,0:23:27.76,Text,,0,0,0,,Cry all you want, but it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.67,0:23:30.47,Text,,0,0,0,,What will you do with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.84,0:23:33.05,Text,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I'm selling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.56,Text,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.81,0:23:39.85,Text,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:42.60,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:45.69,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.99,0:23:52.86,Text,,0,0,0,,There's no use crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.95,0:23:56.53,Text,,0,0,0,,That boat's headed for the island of Sado.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.70,0:23:59.66,Text,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.83,0:24:02.00,Text,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.83,0:24:06.00,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.71,0:24:09.46,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.88,0:24:13.68,Text,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg you,\Ntake us back to the other boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.76,0:24:15.68,Text,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.51,0:24:18.18,Text,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.72,0:24:19.81,Text,,0,0,0,,Kikuno!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.77,0:25:08.82,Behind the Scenes,,0,0,0,,This is the residence\Nof the wealthiest man in Yura,...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.98,0:25:12.03,Behind the Scenes,,0,0,0,,...the High Steward Sansho.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.38,0:25:37.59,Text,,0,0,0,,Hiro, make sure this is finished in a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.80,0:25:39.22,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.19,0:25:51.27,Text,,0,0,0,,Get back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.53,0:26:02.08,Text,,0,0,0,,Saburo, leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.83,0:26:10.71,Text,,0,0,0,,High Steward, these are the ones I bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.25,0:26:13.13,Text,,0,0,0,,What are your names?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.71,0:26:15.76,Text,,0,0,0,,Answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.88,0:26:18.80,Text,,0,0,0,,What about you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.14,0:26:21.22,Text,,0,0,0,,Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.01,0:26:24.18,Text,,0,0,0,,Answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.68,0:26:27.23,Text,,0,0,0,,Gonroku, did you buy a pair of mutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.31,0:26:29.60,Text,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.15,0:26:32.65,Text,,0,0,0,,Speak, children!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.86,0:26:36.07,Text,,0,0,0,,Can you say anything or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.24,0:26:39.70,Text,,0,0,0,,Talk! I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.78,0:26:42.12,Text,,0,0,0,,You're responsible for this purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.70,0:26:45.95,Text,,0,0,0,,I'll punish them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.21,0:26:50.21,Text,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.92,0:26:53.84,Text,,0,0,0,,They must be too hungry to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.02,0:27:07.93,Text,,0,0,0,,What a horrible place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.73,0:27:18.61,Behind the Scenes,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.03,0:27:28.16,Text,,0,0,0,,If you two try to escape from this place,\Nthe same will happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.83,0:27:30.71,Behind the Scenes,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.25,0:27:36.63,Text,,0,0,0,,This is for fetching water.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.97,0:27:41.97,Text,,0,0,0,,This is for gathering wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.85,0:27:47.39,Text,,0,0,0,,You will get up at the crack of dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.23,0:27:50.39,Text,,0,0,0,,Answer "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.15,0:27:54.02,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.86,0:27:58.03,Text,,0,0,0,,I am the slavemaster, Gonroku.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.07,0:28:01.57,Text,,0,0,0,,If you disobey me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.16,0:28:04.37,Text,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.38,0:28:17.88,Text,,0,0,0,,- Stop it, Zushio.\N- I'm so angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.88,0:28:24.09,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:29.22,Text,,0,0,0,,We must be patient, no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.06,0:28:31.06,Text,,0,0,0,,Alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.70,0:28:48.41,Text,,0,0,0,,Sure was easy to trick those idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.83,0:28:52.83,Text,,0,0,0,,One of mine was trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.29,0:28:55.38,Text,,0,0,0,,Too bad we lost her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.04,0:28:58.75,Text,,0,0,0,,Gimme some more...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.89,0:29:13.73,Text,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.24,0:29:25.99,Text,,0,0,0,,Sea's getting rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.91,0:29:33.25,Text,,0,0,0,,Strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.50,0:29:38.04,Text,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.29,0:30:17.92,Text,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.38,0:30:20.84,Text,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.27,0:30:35.31,Text,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.47,0:31:15.56,Text,,0,0,0,,Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.22,0:31:19.44,Text,,0,0,0,,I can't work with so little to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.40,0:31:25.32,Text,,0,0,0,,You can have mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.08,0:31:38.87,Text,,0,0,0,,Here's some candy for you. Cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.21,0:31:42.33,Text,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.48,0:32:46.36,Text,,0,0,0,,Kikuno!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.34,0:33:11.38,Text,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.15,0:33:29.40,Text,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.46,0:33:53.34,Text,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.76,0:33:58.64,Text,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.60,0:34:03.56,Text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.11,0:34:12.73,Text,,0,0,0,,- You're a strange boy.\N- Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.49,0:34:16.24,Text,,0,0,0,,All of the animals like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.70,0:34:20.58,Text,,0,0,0,,I like the animals too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.33,0:34:24.16,Text,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Moku and the others are...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.46,0:34:29.63,Text,,0,0,0,,By the way, what is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.25,0:34:34.67,Text,,0,0,0,,I am Zushio-maru.\NMy father is Officer Masauji Iwaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.80,0:34:36.51,Text,,0,0,0,,What, an officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.22,0:34:38.43,Text,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.05,0:34:45.06,Text,,0,0,0,,He's kind and gentle to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.73,0:34:49.23,Text,,0,0,0,,I see. I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.20,0:35:02.12,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.08,0:35:07.75,Text,,0,0,0,,- Let me help.\N- No, I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.29,0:35:14.67,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio has told me your whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.96,0:35:18.88,Text,,0,0,0,,I've decided to forget about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.36,0:35:33.31,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.57,0:35:37.23,Text,,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.39,0:36:07.89,Text,,0,0,0,,Sister, how do you think Mother is doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.18,0:36:15.15,Text,,0,0,0,,I think she's probably worried about us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.90,0:36:33.58,Song,,0,0,0,,On the shore of the lake, silently
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.58,0:36:45.55,Song,,0,0,0,,Memories from long ago return to me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.51,0:36:59.36,Song,,0,0,0,,I can remember my mother's eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.68,0:38:19.02,Text,,0,0,0,,Those children are always fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.73,0:38:23.32,Text,,0,0,0,,It's true. They are stubborn too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.73,0:38:27.03,Text,,0,0,0,,And the girl is getting\Ntoo friendly with Saburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.28,0:38:28.95,Text,,0,0,0,,What? With Saburo?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.28,0:38:32.74,Text,,0,0,0,,Father, will you punish Saburo?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.99,0:38:36.00,Text,,0,0,0,,No, just the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.96,0:38:39.54,Text,,0,0,0,,Cut off her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.63,0:38:42.04,Text,,0,0,0,,And give them harder work.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.93,0:38:56.52,Text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.73,0:38:57.69,Text,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.31,0:39:01.31,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.40,0:39:03.57,Text,,0,0,0,,Wait! This is your warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.03,0:39:13.41,Text,,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.75,0:39:24.75,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.70,0:41:13.99,Text,,0,0,0,,Just a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.20,0:41:16.78,Text,,0,0,0,,You had one too?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.74,0:41:19.70,Text,,0,0,0,,Luckily it was only a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.55,0:41:38.89,Text,,0,0,0,,Look, Zushio. What a beautiful sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.51,0:41:40.47,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.06,0:41:47.23,Text,,0,0,0,,Listen, on the other side of\Nthat mountain lies Kokubunji Temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.56,0:41:52.53,Text,,0,0,0,,They say it's only\Nthree days away from Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.99,0:42:02.12,Text,,0,0,0,,- You should flee from here now.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.58,0:42:04.79,Text,,0,0,0,,Go to Kyoto and find Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.91,0:42:05.91,Text,,0,0,0,,Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.62,0:42:08.25,Text,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.59,0:42:12.05,Text,,0,0,0,,- Let's go together!\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.63,0:42:17.84,Text,,0,0,0,,- I would slow you down.\N- No!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.26,0:42:20.01,Text,,0,0,0,,I won't go without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.60,0:42:22.68,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.22,0:42:26.56,Text,,0,0,0,,You should listen to your big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.73,0:42:30.73,Text,,0,0,0,,But what if they punish you later?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.19,0:42:34.15,Text,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. Saburo will help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.78,0:42:37.99,Text,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.16,0:42:41.78,Text,,0,0,0,,Now hurry, before they see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.12,0:42:43.24,Text,,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.33,0:42:51.79,Text,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.30,0:42:56.30,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.05,0:43:03.14,Text,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.20,0:43:26.33,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.77,0:43:57.90,Text,,0,0,0,,- Find him?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.19,0:44:00.65,Text,,0,0,0,,Idiot! You're too careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.07,0:44:02.70,Text,,0,0,0,,Bring me the sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.95,0:44:09.12,Text,,0,0,0,,Well? Where did your brother go?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.92,0:44:13.13,Text,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.13,0:44:20.26,Text,,0,0,0,,Saburo, did you help the boy escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.76,0:44:24.34,Text,,0,0,0,,Jiro, send out men to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.91,0:45:30.12,Text,,0,0,0,,Please, protect Zushio\Nand let him reach Kyoto safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.99,0:45:31.87,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.21,0:45:34.21,Text,,0,0,0,,Saburo!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.85,0:45:58.90,Text,,0,0,0,,Kokubunji Temple is suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.24,0:46:08.99,Text,,0,0,0,,We are Lord Sansho's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.49,0:46:11.49,Text,,0,0,0,,We're looking for a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.29,0:46:16.08,Text,,0,0,0,,Answer, or we'll break the door down.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.17,0:46:18.42,Text,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.79,0:46:19.46,Text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.17,0:46:27.13,Text,,0,0,0,,Don't you know this temple?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.43,0:46:30.97,Text,,0,0,0,,With all due respect,\Nit's under the protection of the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.93,0:46:32.97,Text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.43,0:46:37.19,Text,,0,0,0,,Do you still want to enter by force?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.35,0:46:40.48,Text,,0,0,0,,Just try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.19,0:46:44.86,Text,,0,0,0,,Find out what happens\Nif you rebel against the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.11,0:46:47.11,Text,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.21,0:47:02.38,Text,,0,0,0,,Here, give this letter\Nto the Chief Advisor in Kyoto,...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.54,0:47:04.55,Text,,0,0,0,,...and ask him for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.05,0:47:07.38,Text,,0,0,0,,I will. Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.14,0:47:14.47,Text,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.27,0:47:25.15,Text,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.28,0:47:28.24,Text,,0,0,0,,You've only given me trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.62,0:47:41.04,Text,,0,0,0,,Now confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.83,0:47:43.38,Text,,0,0,0,,Or would you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.50,0:47:47.38,Text,,0,0,0,,Or, instead of being punished,...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.30,0:47:50.01,Text,,0,0,0,,...how about marrying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.43,0:47:53.35,Text,,0,0,0,,- What do you say?\N- No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.10,0:47:55.22,Text,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.35,0:47:58.93,Text,,0,0,0,,You insolent girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.36,0:48:05.52,Text,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.28,0:48:13.28,Text,,0,0,0,,Ah, Saburo!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.24,0:48:15.41,Text,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.04,0:48:18.20,Text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.43,0:48:33.64,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.31,0:48:39.18,Text,,0,0,0,,Run away! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.68,0:48:40.64,Text,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.51,0:49:13.59,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.28,0:51:02.24,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.76,0:52:47.22,Text,,0,0,0,,Father, the building!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.46,0:54:01.55,Song,,0,0,0,,The saddest thing... The saddest thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.80,0:54:06.80,Song,,0,0,0,,About a wandering life...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.30,0:54:14.39,Song,,0,0,0,,Is sleeping on the floor\Nnot knowing about tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.64,0:54:17.40,Song,,0,0,0,,Past the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.69,0:54:20.77,Song,,0,0,0,,Through the valleys,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.98,0:54:26.32,Song,,0,0,0,,From East to West
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.82,0:54:33.41,Song,,0,0,0,,A cold wind chills...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.91,0:54:38.46,Song,,0,0,0,,To the bone
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.75,0:54:39.71,Text,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.88,0:54:47.68,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.01,0:54:50.97,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.73,0:55:40.73,Text,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.90,0:55:45.02,Text,,0,0,0,,That worked pretty well!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.65,0:55:46.69,Text,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.90,0:55:49.78,Text,,0,0,0,,We're finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.53,0:55:52.45,Text,,0,0,0,,Hurry, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.78,0:55:57.41,Captions,,0,0,0,,YURA PARISH
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.12,0:56:03.79,Text,,0,0,0,,I can smell Anju.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.90,0:56:30.53,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.70,0:56:34.07,Text,,0,0,0,,Must be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.45,0:56:42.62,Text,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.00,0:56:45.84,Text,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.09,0:56:48.59,Text,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.55,0:56:51.59,Text,,0,0,0,,What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.88,0:56:53.55,Text,,0,0,0,,Well, like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.40,0:57:13.66,Text,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.91,0:57:17.58,Text,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.54,0:57:28.67,Text,,0,0,0,,Maybe here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.56,0:57:48.82,Text,,0,0,0,,It's Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.86,0:57:56.45,Text,,0,0,0,,You finally came.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.66,0:58:07.21,Text,,0,0,0,,I really hope we find Zushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.83,0:58:10.80,Text,,0,0,0,,Kyoto is far away...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.02,0:58:26.52,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.69,0:58:30.19,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.91,0:58:48.17,Text,,0,0,0,,Princess, the cherry trees have blossomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.04,0:58:51.84,Text,,0,0,0,,Wow, how pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.76,0:59:04.52,Song,,0,0,0,,Cherry blossoms, cherry blossoms,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.60,0:59:11.90,Song,,0,0,0,,Invited by spring in Kyoto
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.48,0:59:19.86,Song,,0,0,0,,Called forth by Kiyomizu Temple
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.28,0:59:28.50,Song,,0,0,0,,From the heart of a young maiden...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.75,0:59:35.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Comes a prayer
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.88,0:59:39.51,Song,,0,0,0,,Cherry blossoms, cherry blossoms,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.63,0:59:42.55,Song,,0,0,0,,Kiyomizu Temple...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.89,0:59:50.52,Text,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.78,0:59:58.74,Text,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.74,1:00:00.03,Text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.95,1:00:08.91,Text,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.00,1:00:11.96,Text,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?\N- Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.29,1:00:16.67,Text,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.55,1:00:20.63,Text,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.85,1:00:28.85,Text,,0,0,0,,Brat!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.06,1:00:30.77,Text,,0,0,0,,It's Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.89,1:00:33.02,Text,,0,0,0,,You're right, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.98,1:00:35.86,Text,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.02,1:00:38.99,Text,,0,0,0,,- Zushio!\N- Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.07,1:00:41.82,Text,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see you!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.66,1:00:49.83,Text,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.19,1:01:19.65,Text,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.98,1:01:22.40,Text,,0,0,0,,You are very strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.95,1:01:26.03,Text,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for saving us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.74,1:01:31.20,Text,,0,0,0,,I am Princess Aya,\NMorozane Fujiwara's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.29,1:01:35.25,Text,,0,0,0,,What? Isn't he the Emperor's Chief Advisor?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.92,1:01:44.72,Text,,0,0,0,,I understand your situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.84,1:01:49.31,Text,,0,0,0,,So you came all the way here\Nin search of your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.39,1:01:50.22,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.85,1:01:53.35,Text,,0,0,0,,I see. Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.10,1:01:56.44,Text,,0,0,0,,...your father is no longer here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.73,1:01:58.65,Text,,0,0,0,,What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.65,1:02:02.86,Text,,0,0,0,,He was found guilty, and ha exiled to Kyushu.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.32,1:02:09.08,Text,,0,0,0,,Please, Father,\Nsend out a messenger right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.28,1:02:11.33,Text,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.44,1:02:46.36,Text,,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.82,1:03:33.08,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.99,1:03:36.16,Text,,0,0,0,,Father told me...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.37,1:03:38.16,Text,,0,0,0,,Hmm? About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.41,1:03:41.29,Text,,0,0,0,,He's going to help you study...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.38,1:03:44.09,Text,,0,0,0,,...about literature and martial arts.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.21,1:03:48.38,Text,,0,0,0,,Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.05,1:03:51.18,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.47,1:03:58.56,Text,,0,0,0,,Sir Masauji has passed away.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.77,1:03:59.60,Text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.31,1:04:02.81,Text,,0,0,0,,But how did he...?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.56,1:04:06.40,Text,,0,0,0,,What did my father die from?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.53,1:04:08.99,Text,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately it was\Ndue to a prolonged illness or so have I heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.99,1:04:12.11,Text,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.74,1:04:15.37,Text,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.72,1:04:32.80,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.85,1:04:37.93,Text,,0,0,0,,I understand your sadness,...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.31,1:04:42.14,Text,,0,0,0,,...but you're still a  young boy, and you\Ncan't let misfortune overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.03,1:04:52.41,Text,,0,0,0,,Think of me as your father now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.70,1:04:55.41,Text,,0,0,0,,Stay here and continue your studies.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.53,1:04:59.16,Text,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be able to\Nsave your mother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.54,1:05:01.66,Text,,0,0,0,,All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.46,1:05:03.00,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.89,1:06:04.14,Text,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.06,1:06:44.10,Text,,0,0,0,,Can you take a little break?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.60,1:06:45.23,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.73,1:06:46.94,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.02,1:06:50.77,Text,,0,0,0,,Have you heard the news from the Palace?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.98,1:06:52.94,Text,,0,0,0,,No. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.90,1:06:57.86,Text,,0,0,0,,Lately, they've been speaking\Nabout a horrible monster...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.95,1:07:00.66,Text,,0,0,0,,...that comes to the Emperor's room at night.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.78,1:07:03.62,Text,,0,0,0,,- What? A monster?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.99,1:07:07.12,Text,,0,0,0,,If it continues,\Nthe Emperor's life may be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.29,1:07:08.87,Text,,0,0,0,,My father told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.36,1:11:03.86,Text,,0,0,0,,Are you Zushio?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.40,1:11:05.24,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.24,1:11:11.28,Text,,0,0,0,,The feat you have\Naccomplished is truly outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.33,1:11:14.08,Text,,0,0,0,,- Morozane.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.83,1:11:19.54,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.04,1:11:22.42,Text,,0,0,0,,You are now the Governor of Mutsu Province.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.84,1:11:25.80,Text,,0,0,0,,And Taira-no-Masamichi is your new name.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.42,1:11:28.43,Text,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.22,1:11:32.30,Text,,0,0,0,,May you become as\Ngreat a man as your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.81,1:11:33.56,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.52,1:11:37.94,Text,,0,0,0,,Onikura, who had falsely accused your father,...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.44,1:11:42.36,Text,,0,0,0,,...shall be stripped of his post and punished.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.12,1:11:54.54,Text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.58,1:11:59.54,Text,,0,0,0,,I will visit your province\Nwhen I have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.12,1:12:02.38,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes, you'll be welcome there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.38,1:12:06.55,Text,,0,0,0,,You take care, Princess Aya.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.42,1:12:10.43,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes, you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.30,1:12:15.35,Text,,0,0,0,,Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.10,1:12:21.14,Text,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.27,1:12:24.98,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio has become Governor\Nof Mutsu and he's headed here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.27,1:12:27.23,Text,,0,0,0,,What? Zushio?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.86,1:12:30.57,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes, that boy who ran away.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.12,1:12:35.20,Text,,0,0,0,,Jiro.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.95,1:12:38.04,Text,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.43,1:12:54.47,Text,,0,0,0,,Don't mess up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.14,1:13:38.14,Text,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.99,1:14:34.74,Text,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.70,1:14:40.24,Text,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.50,1:14:50.13,Text,,0,0,0,,- Gonroku.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.54,1:14:53.42,Text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming out to welcome me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.09,1:14:55.26,Text,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.63,1:14:59.18,Text,,0,0,0,,Good. I have not come here to punish you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.30,1:15:03.18,Text,,0,0,0,,I want to see my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.06,1:15:05.48,Text,,0,0,0,,She is...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.10,1:15:07.44,Text,,0,0,0,,Where is my sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.27,1:15:10.52,Text,,0,0,0,,Well... you see...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.40,1:15:13.07,Text,,0,0,0,,What have you done with her?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.11,1:15:22.66,Text,,0,0,0,,- You are...\N- Yes, I am Saburo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.04,1:15:25.62,Text,,0,0,0,,But your clothes...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.66,1:15:30.04,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes, the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.30,1:16:21.47,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.68,1:16:26.14,Text,,0,0,0,,I deeply regret what has happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.27,1:16:36.40,Text,,0,0,0,,Please forgive my father and brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.40,1:16:42.24,Text,,0,0,0,,- Lord Sansho.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.12,1:16:47.37,Text,,0,0,0,,Release all your slaves and\Nlet them return to their homes today.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.74,1:16:51.62,Text,,0,0,0,,- But that's...\N- You refuse? The Emperor demands it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.87,1:16:53.38,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.64,1:18:31.81,Text,,0,0,0,,Saburo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.77,1:18:37.23,Text,,0,0,0,,Please take good care of my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.98,1:18:38.90,Text,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.86,1:18:41.69,Text,,0,0,0,,Do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.44,1:18:44.90,Text,,0,0,0,,I hope you find your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.91,1:19:36.71,Song,,0,0,0,,How I miss you, Anju
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.75,1:19:46.59,Song,,0,0,0,,How I miss you, Zushio
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.05,1:19:55.72,Song,,0,0,0,,If you understand my words,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.85,1:20:05.78,Song,,0,0,0,,Go away birds, and be good
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.94,1:20:15.45,Song,,0,0,0,,How I miss you, Anju
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.95,1:20:24.71,Song,,0,0,0,,How I miss you, Zushio
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.79,1:20:21.83,Text,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.01,1:20:32.55,Text,,0,0,0,,Mother! It's me, Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.70,1:20:52.74,Text,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.49,1:20:56.66,Text,,0,0,0,,Zushio!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.13,1:21:49.67,Text,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Anju.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.89,1:21:58.05,Text,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.85,1:22:03.98,Text,,0,0,0,,Even with these eyes,\NI can see a white bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.69,1:22:12.15,Text,,0,0,0,,You know, Zushio,...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.57,1:22:16.66,Text,,0,0,0,,...maybe she is happy living that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.03,1:23:00.58,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1700,700)\fs290\pos(1000,684)}THE END
